  EpochOpen --> SnapshotPending
  SnapshotPending --> SnapshotTaken
  SnapshotTaken --> AntiWashFinalized
  AntiWashFinalized --> RootBuilt
  RootBuilt --> SafeQueued
  SafeQueued --> Published
